/* spring-fest.html — section 2 of 10.

   Every number here is from the brochures in asset/iit kgp/, which are
   also the two PDFs linked on this page. 1960, 130+ events and the
   80,000 footfall are Spring Fest's own figures, printed as theirs; the
   2027 line-up is deliberately absent, because the fest has not
   announced it and we do not print line-ups before they do. */
---

<section class="sec s-paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="slug"><b>01</b><span>The fest that has been running since 1960</span><span class="ln"></span><span class="m hide-s">IIT Kharagpur · West Bengal</span></p>
    <div class="split">
      <h2 class="d-l" data-split>Five days, <span class="it">true spirit of youth</span></h2>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="lede">Spring Fest is IIT Kharagpur’s annual social and cultural festival, and we are the Official Trip Partner for 2027</p>
        <p class="body muted">It has run since 1960 under one line, True Spirit of Youth, past editions have put on more than 130 events and drawn a footfall of over 80,000 in 2019, you get yourself to Howrah or Kharagpur station and everything after that is handled</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="facts mt-64">
      <div class="fact"><small>Trip dates</small><b>21 Jan → 25 Jan</b></div>
      <div class="fact"><small>Starting from</small><b class="tabular">₹4,999</b></div>
      <div class="fact"><small>You sleep</small><b>IIT KGP hostel</b></div>
      <div class="fact"><small>Fest days</small><b>Three</b></div>
    </div>
    <div class="frames mt-64">
      <figure class="frame mask"><div class="ph" data-vf="Frame 01A"><img src="/assets/img/sf-crowd.jpg" alt="Students crowding into one selfie on campus at Spring Fest" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="dstamp">01 22 ’27</span></div><div class="fn"><span>AS 400 ▸ 01A</span><span>Campus</span></div><figcaption class="fc">Different colleges, one photo</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="frame mask"><div class="ph" data-vf="Frame 02A"><img src="/assets/img/sf-classical.jpg" alt="A classical dance troupe in full costume on stage" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="dstamp">01 22 ’27</span></div><div class="fn"><span>AS 400 ▸ 02A</span><span>Stage</span></div><figcaption class="fc">Competitions through the day</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="frame mask"><div class="ph" data-vf="Frame 03A"><img src="/assets/img/sf-fashion.jpg" alt="A model walking the ramp at night with the crowd behind" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="dstamp">01 23 ’27</span></div><div class="fn"><span>AS 400 ▸ 03A</span><span>Ramp</span></div><figcaption class="fc">Then the evening shows</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="frame mask"><div class="ph" data-vf="Frame 04A"><img src="/assets/img/sf-stage.jpg" alt="Fireworks over the main stage with the crowd in front of it" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="dstamp">01 24 ’27</span></div><div class="fn"><span>AS 400 ▸ 04A</span><span>Night</span></div><figcaption class="fc">And the main stage after dark</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <p class="fine mt-24">Photographs from Spring Fest 2026, courtesy of Spring Fest, IIT Kharagpur. The 2027 line-up and schedule come from the fest, we plan the trip around what they announce</p>
  </div>
</section>
